{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43291","headline":"珠还合浦 · 邓陟","name":"珠还合浦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"至宝含冲粹，清虚映浦湾。\n素辉明荡漾，圆彩色玢㻞。\n昔逐诸侯去，今随太守还。\n影摇波里月，光动水中山。\n鱼目徒相比，骊龙乍可攀。\n愿将车饰用，长得耀君颜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"邓陟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43291.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43291","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}